    "GateConfiguration": {
      "description": "What this deployment was configured to do, at the moment of the run.\n\nAn evidence pack answers \"what was verified\". Without this it cannot answer\n\"under what\", and the two runs someone will eventually put side by side\ndiffer precisely there: a rule was edited, a gate was switched off, a\ncoverage bar was lowered, the judgment model was turned off, a different\nimage ran the tools. Each of those is one line here instead of something a\nreader has to reconstruct from an environment that has since moved on.\n\n``rules_sha256`` is ``None`` when no rule library was configured, never an\nempty string: \"there was no file\" and \"the file was empty\" are different\nfacts, and only one of them explains a review gate that found nothing.\n\nDeliberately **not** part of the approval fingerprint. The fingerprint\nbinds a signature to the commit, the policy version and the rule version;\nfolding a threshold into it would invalidate every approval the moment an\noperator tuned one, which is a different decision from the one this\nsnapshot makes. It records; the fingerprint decides.\n\nIt carries no credential. The provider and the model name say which service\nwas asked, never what it was asked with.",
      "properties": {
        "changed_line_coverage_threshold": {
          "default": 0.0,
          "title": "Changed Line Coverage Threshold",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "coverage_threshold": {
          "default": 0.0,
          "title": "Coverage Threshold",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "deployed_gates": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Deployed Gates",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "disabled_gates": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Disabled Gates",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "docker_image": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Docker Image"
        },
        "fail_closed": {
          "default": true,
          "title": "Fail Closed",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "language": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Language",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "model": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Model"
        },
        "model_explain": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Model Explain",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "model_judgment": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Model Judgment",
          "type": "boolean"
